WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.920
Who's this?!

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.750
Huh? These are the mother data files...

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:11.920
Mother?

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:17.180
They provide the mother genes to
the newest generation Neo-Genes.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:24.600
This is... This is my mom!

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.310
We've kept our promise.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.940
Now let us check your condition
now that you are wearing the Cloneblade.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:40.580
I have high hopes that
you are perfect, Maria...

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:46.750
My mom... Mine...

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:24.180
"Bonds"

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:43.160
No, we can't be together...

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.710
Breakdown progressing.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:57.590
Mental condition has
also begun to deteriorate.

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:03.340
However, it is not as
unpleasant as anticipated.

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:05.140
In fact, it feels nice.

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:09.890
Is this how Shiori felt as she broke down?

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:16.730
Or might these be the motherly
feelings I've been trying to ascertain?

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:20.740
Unknown.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.350
It's not Kahlúa, but...

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.400
It's quiet here...

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:05.110
Yeah.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.160
This was my old man's second house.

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:16.170
Say. Is this...

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:22.760
Is this to comfort me?

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:27.590
I...
No, you don't need to say.

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:36.810
"Tozawa Yusuke"

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:38.230
Hello?

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:41.530
I finally got through! Where are you?!

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:45.860
Oh. Around...

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:47.740
Anyways, go get Rihoko right now!

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:48.820
Eh?!

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:55.460
Listen. These NSWF "sisters"
aren't just people with chosen genes.

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:59.580
They also supply genes
of their own, as mothers.

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:02.340
In some pretty messed-up inbreeding.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:04.420
Inbreeding?! What?!

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:10.390
Basically, the "sisters" all
have genes from the same father,

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:15.560
and that father's genes are used with
the next generation of sisters, too.

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:17.520
So to this guy,

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:21.940
the sisters are his daughters,
wives, and granddaughters.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:26.360
From what I can tell, this guy is "Father"...

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:27.820
Are you serious?

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:31.830
Dunno what he's up to,
but it's not anything normal.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.870
No matter how far she is from the NSWF,

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:37.410
Sohou Reina's one of the sisters too.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:40.830
On top of that, she's not a normal person.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:42.710
Take Rihoko back.

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:46.760
You don't need to leave
her with that monster.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:52.390
You listenin', Masamune?!

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:55.770
I'm a monster too, you know.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:05:59.850
What are you ?!

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:02.770
I'm not fit to take her back.

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.360
Hey!

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.150
Damn it!

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:11.570
Not fit, my ass.
You were worried like crazy...

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:14.870
What was that about?

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:19.410
He told me to take Rihoko
back because Lady's a monster.

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:23.380
Like I'm anyone to talk, though.

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:31.760
Lady saved Rihoko. Twice, in fact.

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:39.100
She's rich, a doctor,

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:44.520
and more than anything,
she's her real mother...

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:49.780
She can make Rihoko
much happier than I can.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:56.740
If you really feel that way,
then there's no need to worry anymore.

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.170
Yeah...

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:09.170
Here's breakfast, Maria.

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:16.050
Dr. Nishida is gone today on
business, so you can have the day off.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:17.470
Really?!

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:20.060
I can get the car if
you'd like to go shopping.

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:22.560
No! I'll just play in my room!

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:25.730
Oh? Then be a good girl!

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:44.750
She's my mom,
so she has to be with me!

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:52.050
It's actually against regulations
to copy personal data, y'know...

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.840
I'm just taking notes.

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:57.850
We're not supposed
to show these to outsiders...

00:07:57.930 --> 00:08:03.600
Shelving those secret restaurant
meeting photos sure did hurt...

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:05.560
Here we go!

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:11.030
Umm... Are you better now?

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:11.900
Eh?

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:15.320
You didn't seem well last night, so...

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:19.740
Oh, it's nothing. I'm fine.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:43.770
Stay still.

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:00.740
Mom!

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:10.750
What are you ?

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:25.140
It's a different Blade version...

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.980
The fact that I don't
recognize her must mean

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.860
she's a next-generation Neo-Gene...

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:33.940
What do you want?

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:35.820
What's that?

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:38.860
My daughter.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:44.950
How come? Why? You're my mom...

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.080
Why?!

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:52.040
This girl is dangerous. She's limitless...

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:56.880
It was in that file... Does that mean...

00:09:56.970 --> 00:10:00.890
Say, is that my big sister?

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.180
That's right.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.930
Why is it so puny?

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:09.810
She was born naturally.

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:12.020
The file said it died.

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:17.530
It must've been an old file.
Or it was purposely incorrect.

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.400
I don't care about that!

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:22.370
Wait for me inside the car in the garage.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:27.580
Let's calm down and have a nice talk.

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:32.750
I need to go shopping.
Could you wait in here a bit?

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:33.790
Okay!

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:41.760
It's all for me!

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:46.770
No...

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:53.730
It belongs to that.

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:08.790
This is a lie. It's all a lie...

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:13.380
I mean, this isn't possible...

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.170
Why?

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.260
Tell me...

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:26.930
I trained and studied so hard...
And she's my mom...

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:29.220
So why?!

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:32.100
Why is she with something else?!

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:34.900
Why won't she give me a big hug?!

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:37.400
Why?! Why?!

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:38.730
Why?!

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:45.570
She really does have incredible power...

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:56.580
What the hell?! Not now!

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:05.180
Time to die...

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:15.900
What the ?!

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:17.980
What is it?!

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:20.860
Something... just now...

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:23.950
An X-Con? A Neo-Gene?

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:27.820
I'm not sure... It's far away...

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:30.580
But... it's really strong...

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:03.490
She's coming!

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:06.610
Umm, maybe we should walk back?

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:09.570
No. We can't.
But...

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:16.750
I have little chance of winning
against that power. But...

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.590
Stay here.

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:24.550
Where are you going?

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:27.220
Just stay here!

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:28.760
Okay...

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:33.180
It's all right. I'll be back for you.

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:45.740
She seemed a little bit like Mom just now...

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:49.780
A second generation
Neo-Gene has appeared.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:55.700
I appear to be the target.
Have decided to split up from Rihoko.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:59.080
It's all right. I'll be back for you.

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:03.170
Why did I make such
a groundless promise?

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:07.170
Mom?

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:14.060
It would seem that's the case,
at least genetically...

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:15.930
It's over there, isn't it?

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:18.770
I'm going to get rid of it. Move.

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:20.730
No, I'm afraid not.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:29.740
You hate me too... You're my mom, so why?

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:33.740
Why?! Why?!

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:40.580
You can disappear too...

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:48.170
There it goes... There it goes!

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.770
M-Monsters?

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.360
Rihoko! It's me!

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:08.570
Tozawa-Chan!

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:15.830
Tozawa-Chan! What are you doing here?

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:18.160
Uhh, hard to explain.

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:23.750
Stop the car!

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:29.380
What is it?!
I can feel it! Riko's in danger!

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:32.380
That feeling from before, huh?

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.720
What'll you do?

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:36.720
I thought you weren't fit as a mother?

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:38.220
Riko!

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:41.600
That answers that.

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:51.150
Stop dodging, Mom!
It makes me mad when I miss!

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:22.770
Aww, how disappointing.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:31.690
It smells good here too, for some reason...

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:33.320
Where's it coming from?

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:36.450
Tozawa-Chan. Are those...

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:38.280
Yeah, they're monsters.

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:42.580
You probably didn't know,
but things like them do exist!

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:51.170
Here we go!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:02.770
I won't let you lay a finger on her!

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:07.400
Hey. Are you done already?

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:10.570
Then that other one is next!

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:15.820
Why are you stopping me?!

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:19.740
Good question... It is incomprehensible...

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:22.160
This isn't my mom...

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:38.720
N-No way!

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:40.390
It hurts...

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:46.430
You shouldn't go overboard
with your power...

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:51.150
There's no point to it if you
don't fully understand it...

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:57.450
There she is! Recover her at once!

00:17:57.530 --> 00:17:59.570
What about the other one?!

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:06.580
There's no need now...

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.750
It's alright! Your mom's on her way!

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:14.050
Mom is?

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:18.170
Takin' care of monsters
like them is your mom's job.

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:20.930
That's not true!
It's the truth!

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:22.600
Mom's...

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:29.890
But... she won't come.
She isn't my mom anymore...

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:32.060
She'll come!

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:35.730
Why do you think she does
such dangerous work?

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:38.570
Listen. It's all for you.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:45.740
She's always fought for you,
and only you...

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:54.750
Your mom loves you...

00:18:56.550 --> 00:18:58.670
Riko!

00:18:58.760 --> 00:18:59.760
It's Mom...

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:14.730
Mom...

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:21.150
Mom! Mom!

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:23.530
Riko!

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:31.040
Riko! Are you all right?!

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:32.750
I'm okay!

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:37.840
Mom!

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:53.900
It hurts... Mom...

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:06.820
Reina?

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:10.330
It is you! My recovery team is here!

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:15.290
You know it's over now...

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.590
My time's up...

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:21.170
Where is she?

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:26.930
She's safe.
I see...

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:30.680
Reina... Give her back...

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:36.650
Yes... My research is over now...
Do as you wish with her...

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:38.730
Understood.

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:44.570
Say, that was the first time
I felt pleasure while fighting...

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:50.280
Was it because of my breakdown,
or because I protected her?

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:52.870
I studied myself all this time,

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:56.210
but in the end, I'm still incomprehensible...

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:59.840
I thought I had understood, but...

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:01.170
Reiji...

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:04.880
At one point, for just a moment,

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:10.470
I experienced an incomprehensible
feeling toward you...

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:12.770
For just a moment...

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:54.740
I turn around half-asleep as my hits the right side of my cheek

00:21:54.740 --> 00:22:02.990
Your voice was there, and the air was warm

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:11.260
Your right hand grazes my left shoulder

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.730
But why don't you hold on tight?

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:28.500
In order to change yesterday's wish tomorrow,

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:35.690
I need to grow stronger myself

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:44.840
Even now, I am breathing in your scent, ...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:53.510
and jumping over to your side. Give me your love.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:02.990
Extend your hands. Reach them out to me.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:09.540
I'm so happy

00:23:12.680 --> 00:23:17.350
Great news, Riko! Chou-san
is going to take us to the ocean!

00:23:17.430 --> 00:23:20.980
It's obvious what he's after, but whatever.

00:23:21.060 --> 00:23:23.730
He says Tozawa-chan's friend's
daughter will be coming too,

00:23:23.810 --> 00:23:28.190
and that she's a little older
than you! I can't wait to go!

00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:31.860
l could never take you places much before,

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:34.450
but let's go to lots of places from now on!

00:23:34.530 --> 00:23:37.490
I'm gonna work hard so we can do that!
